		lineageTag: 58c91f52-d639-4401-9080-ab4c21931f81

	/// Income statement only. Forecast, sign-correct: account rows times SignConvention, only RowType "account"
	/// and Statement "Income statement". Revenue positive, costs negative, so that Core visuals need no
